  "rationale": "Assuming comparable observations and the stated recurrence, repeated disagreement between calendar availability and readiness provides a meaningful temporal signal for investigation. The claim only identifies a candidate signal; it does not establish a cause or an effective intervention.",
  "uncertainty": "Recording errors and changing operating conditions can affect interpretation (P024), but do not defeat the bounded candidate-signal claim under the stipulated assumptions.",
